The `/_not-found` page renders outside the provider tree: the `Providers` component sits inside `<LocaleProvider>` in my layout, but `ThemeInit` and the `Schema` in `<head>` are fine; the failure is that `Flex as="html"` layout components call `useLayout` before the `LayoutProvider` is mounted. The original layout had the same structure, so the difference I introduced is the `Flex as="html"` carrying a `style` prop, which is not the cause either. The real cause is that the `html` element itself is a `Flex`, which needs the layout context, and in the original it worked only because `Providers` wrapped the body. I'll render a plain `<html>` instead, so nothing above `Providers` depends on layout context, and pass the font variables through its `style`.

I also added `suppressHydrationWarning` on the plain element for the theme attributes set before paint.

